{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"ordering\">\n  <state id=\"ordering\">\n    <invoke id=\"order\" src=\"invoked/event011-child.scx\"/>\n    <transition event=\"order.ready\"\n                event:schema='{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"count\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"count\"]}'>\n      <send event=\"order.place\" target=\"#_order\"><content>{\"quantity\": \"two\"}</content></send>\n    </transition>\n    <transition event=\"done.invoke.order\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/event011-incompatible-invoked-event-data.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":2},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event011-incompatible-invoked-event-data.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":55,"endLine":5,"startColumn":29,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`invoked/event011-child.scx` sends `order.ready` to `#_parent` with data a transition here handling it does not accept\n\n**Note:** a transition's `event:schema` describes the `_event.data` it handles; the invoked document's `<send target=\"#_parent\">` creates data this transition's event descriptor matches but its schema rejects (events between sessions are not checked at run time yet: the transition is still taken)\n\n**Help:** make the two documents' schemas agree, or change the data the invoked document sends\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>","text":"`invoked/event011-child.scx` sends `order.ready` to `#_parent` with data a transition here handling it does not accept"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":268,"start":242},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"... which fails the schema of this transition"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event011-incompatible-invoked-event-data.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":112,"endLine":7,"startColumn":17,"startLine":7}}}],"ruleId":"EVENT011"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event011-incompatible-invoked-event-data.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":88,"endLine":8,"startColumn":50,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<send>` sends `order.place` to the session of `invoked/event011-child.scx` with data a transition there handling it does not accept\n\n**Note:** a transition's `event:schema` describes the `_event.data` it handles; a transition of the invoked document matches this event but its schema rejects this data (events between sessions are not checked at run time yet: the transition is still taken)\n\n**Help:** make the two documents' schemas agree, or change the data\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>","text":"`<send>` sends `order.place` to the session of `invoked/event011-child.scx` with data a transition there handling it does not accept"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":508,"start":470},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the invoked document, invoked as `#_order`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/event011-incompatible-invoked-event-data.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":55,"endLine":5,"startColumn":29,"startLine":5}}}],"ruleId":"EVENT011"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 6.4 lets a session and the session it invokes exchange events: the invoker sends to `#_<invokeid>`, and the invoked session sends to `#_parent`. When the caller supplies the documents a document's literal `<invoke src>` elements load (`scx validate`, `compile`, and `run` read `file:` ones; the validator component and the browser host take `invoked-documents`), a `<send event=\"x\">` with a literal target from an ECMAScript sender is judged against the receiving document's transitions handling `x` (SCXML 3.12.1 descriptor matching) exactly as `EVENT010` judges one document's own sends: only when the literal `<content>` data, or a witness of the sender's own literal schema, provably fails the transition's literal `event:schema`. Every label is in the validated document, which names the invoked document by its `src`. Events between sessions are not checked at run time yet, so the transition is still taken"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: make the two documents' schemas agree, or change the data.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>\n\nRun `scx --explain EVENT011` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#invoke","id":"EVENT011","name":"EVENT011","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<send>` between a document and an `<invoke src>` document creates event data the receiving transition does not accept"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}